          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 13.08,
          "en": "Well, first of all we remove the loader in the child route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "because we don't want to have it anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 16.713,
          "en": "in use cases like this one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "Then as a next step, we can remove this import, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.27,
