        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.63,
          "end": 69.003,
          "en": "And this route doesn't have a loader anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.05,
          "end": 73.38,
          "en": "So what we need is data from the loader of the parent route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
